            "created_at": "2025-08-25T19:11:56.717079+00:00",
            "notes": "Just play as you would play Cass in normal Competitive play - stay with the tank, don't die, don't do stupid stuff, and deal out as much damage as possible. Farm credits, and remember to abuse  [Just Roll With It](item_71918d53-d84e-48f1-9940-8fbe0d9d5a41) if you find yourself getting hit with burst damage, e.g. Freja's Take Aim.\n\n**POWER:**\n\n\u2b50 [Just Roll With It](item_71918d53-d84e-48f1-9940-8fbe0d9d5a41) - Combat Roll with now grant a 75% damage reduction and heal you for 30% max HP on a 6 sec cooldown. Just stupid good, and can be used to pump up your credits in the early rounds as well.\n\n**CORE ITEMS:**\n\n\u2b50 [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) - the most important green in the game, and one of the best bang for your buck items for Cass. Keep it for as long as you can, every other green is replaceable.\n\n**OPTIONAL:**\n\n- \ud83d\udfe9 [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) - if vs. duo hitscan, e.g.  [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546),   [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54), etc. Generally the best option, since it directly reduces the amount of credits the enemy team receives.\n- \ud83d\udfe9 [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) - if vs.  [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1),  [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0),  [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457).\n- \ud83d\udfe9  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) - if you're playing to take a lot of duels early.\n- \ud83d\udfe8  [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) - if you're playing for picks.\n- \ud83d\udfe8 [Electrolytes](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900) - if you're playing very aggressive and think you'll die a lot.\n- \ud83d\udfe8  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) - if you're going glass cannon in the 1st round.",
