            "created_at": "2025-08-25T19:11:56.717079+00:00",
            "notes": "Continue playing like you did last round, but you will now really start to hurt due to the Talon power spike. \n\n**CORE ITEMS:**\n\n- \u2b50 [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) - if you got rolled in Round 1, sell everything except Compensator to afford this.\n- \u2b50 [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) - keep holding onto it, incredible value for money.\n\n**OPTIONAL:**\n\n- \ud83d\udfe9 [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) - if vs. problematic [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6),  [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85),  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49). Take it instead of Talon if they're preventing you from shooting the backline.\n- \ud83d\udfe9 [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) - if you have a lot of money left after the purchase of Talon, and you stomped Round 1. Best snowballing option.\n- \ud83d\udfe9 [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) - if you don't have as much money left after the purchase of Talon, and you found yourself in many isolated duels in Round 1.  \n- \ud83d\udfe8 [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) - decent if a enemy hero is in your face very often, helps you burst them down with FtH.\n- \ud83d\udfe8 [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) - it's just quite whatever, but I found myself buying it on days where I wasn't hitting my headshots all that well, helps you burst the backline with bodyshots. Just fire at the tank once and turn your focus to the DPS or healers immediately after.",
