        {
            "id": "0fe0e441-b90e-44c4-88ca-eb89d6ce2711",
            "build_id": "1dbab1be-68da-439d-8473-bf257477664b",
            "round_number": 4,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-25T19:11:56.717079+00:00",
            "notes": "[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is the best purchase here in almost all scenarios. The amount of self-sustain and survivability this item provides is bonkers, I've had multiple games where I could reach around 2k healing on Round 4, thanks to Flux and Roll, and overall, it is the other most cost-effective item you can buy in this game right now. Makes you even tankier, and even deadlier. A must-buy.\n\nRegarding playstyle, just keep doing what you're doing - play aggressively, look for good flanks and off-angles, and pick away at their back line. \n\n**CORE ITEMS:**\n\n- \u2b50 [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)\n- \u2b50 [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f)\n- \u2b50 [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \n- \u2b50 [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \n\n**OPTIONAL:**\n\nI've mentioned the other optional items in the notes for the previous rounds, so I will only talk about the only new addition.\n\n- \ud83d\udfe8 [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) - honestly, I almost never find myself buying anymore. Two headshots will do this item's job, and more. Even the fact that the 25% DOT gets applied on everything that leaves the ground, even jumping and wall-climbing, doesn't save it from the fact that it is lackluster. Buy it only if you feel like a  [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424) or  [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da) keep escaping from you with single-digit HP.",
